<title>SINGAPORE: Gul Technologies sees 15 pct profit growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>Gul Technologies sees 15 pct profit growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Gul Technologies said on Monday it expected to maintain its recent net profit growth rate of about 15 percent in 1997.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
